guide.Add("GenericAll|gpos",new string[]{"The observation concerns the directory portion of a GPO. File permissions and policy applicability also determine its practical effect.","Check both the directory object and SYSVOL permissions, policy links, security filtering, enforcement and inheritance.","Restrict GPO editing and permission management to the approved policy-management role; review the directory and SYSVOL permissions together.","Compare both permission sets and confirm the expected policy applies to a representative authorized user or computer.","A policy or SYSVOL change can affect many machines. Preserve the prior policy and permission settings before an approved change."});
