guide.Add("GenericAll|ous",new string[]{"Rights on a container do not automatically establish control of every child object. Inheritance and policy links require separate evaluation.","Confirm the actual object class and identify which applicable ACEs are inherited by which children.","Narrow unnecessary container-level delegation at its originating scope, preserving required child-object management.","Rescan the container and representative children; test the approved delegated administration workflow.","Changing an inherited container grant can affect many child objects; avoid deleting unrelated explicit permissions."});
